== Trivia ==
* This item is used in {{chal|Darkness Falls}}.
* [[wikipedia:Dark_Matter|Dark Matter]] is a hypothetical form of matter that is thought to account for over 80% of all the matter in the universe. In media, dark matter is often portrayed as an evil element or demonic power, which explains why this item is found in Devil Rooms.

